# Tasks: Sub-Agente SDD-Judge & Governança Constitucional Nativa

**Spec**: [specs/001-sdd-judge-subagent/spec.md](file:///home/andre/projetos/assistidos/vitalia-spec-kit/specs/001-sdd-judge-subagent/spec.md)  
**Plan**: [specs/001-sdd-judge-subagent/plan.md](file:///home/andre/projetos/assistidos/vitalia-spec-kit/specs/001-sdd-judge-subagent/plan.md)  
